            loading="lazy" 
          />
        </div>

        <p>
          Expert consultancy is vital during this transition to avoid "dead-stop" issues where a batch becomes unstable or separates during storage. At Global Formulation, we provide <a href="/from-lab-to-market" target="_top" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">from lab to market</a> scale-up protocols that ensure your industrial batches perfectly match your pilot samples in clarity, foam, and skin-feel.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- SECTION 5 -->
