            <h3 style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px;">3. Can I manufacture hand wash using only SLS?</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.95rem;">
              While technically possible, it is not recommended for premium products. SLS on its own is highly irritating.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="box" style="margin: 0; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px; border-radius: var(--radius-md);">
            <h3 style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px;">4. What is the purpose of pearlizing agents?</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.95rem;">
              Pearlizing agents are purely aesthetic. They create a silken appearance that signals a higher-quality wash to the consumer.
            </p>
