          <div class="box" style="margin: 0; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px; border-radius: var(--radius-md);">
            <h3 style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px;">5. How critical is DI water for production?</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.95rem;">
              Deionized water is critical. Hard water containing minerals can "kill" the foam and interfere with preservatives.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="box" style="margin: 0; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px; border-radius: var(--radius-md);">
            <h3 style="color: var(--primary); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px;">6. How can a startup compete with major MNC brands?</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 0.95rem;">
